SUMMARY:Artist in Residence: Sachém Parkin-Owens
DESCRIPTION:Martin Edge is a Queensland artist whose playful works capture 
 moments from his everyday life\, including both real and imagined adventur
 es. For his Artist in Residence project at Museum of Brisbane\, Edge will 
 transform the walls of the Fairfax Gallery with a large-scale mural create
 d over three weeks. Visitors are invited to watch and engage with the arti
 st as the work unfolds\, offering a rare insight into his creative process
 .
LOCATION:Museum of Brisbane\, Level 3\, Brisbane City Hall King George Squa
 re\, Brisbane 4000
URL:https://www.museumofbrisbane.com.au/whats-on/sachem-parkin-owens/
